/P 169 0 R
/E (      We donated four boxes of FLL parts to support an FLL team in Austin, Texas. This donation allowed for an entire FLL team to have individual robots for each member, allowing students to be able to test ideas individually and then collaborate as a group as well. All together, this allowed the team to be able to work both on teamwork and individual skills.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
