/E (     Whether it be linear discriminant analysis or the Gram-Schmidt process, our STEM Course Series shares knowledge on a broad variety of STEM topics, like linear algebra. With many members of  our team taking university-level courses, we aim to decrease the barrier for high school students to access such resources.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
