/P 171 0 R
/E (     With international roots, we place a strong emphasis on global outreach. Therefore, we took up the opportunity to mentor an FLL Team at High Gate International Academy in Kigali, Rwanda. Each week, we meet with the team to answer any questions they may have, provide guidance on their innovation project, and help them find the same spark we found as young FLL Roboticists. - 49 Hours)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
