/T (     Computer-aided design \(CAD\) is extremely important to us and our entire robot is constructed virtually in the CAD software Fusion 360 before it is built. This allows off-site members to participate in building and helps us check for interference and other potential issues before the more costly build process begins.       From 7th to 12th graders, our team features a large range of ages. As a result, we place an emphasis on mentorship. To onboard hardware members, we introduce them to the following process:)
