374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (For example, consider the shooter. Initially, our design relied on a shooter which was placed on a rotating turret. However, this design had a few issues such as not being able to shoot far enough, shooting consistency, and angle consistency. The flap was initially purposed to vary the angle at which the balls were shot. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4 5 6]
>>
endobj
