/E (Intaking the artifacts primarily involved driving over them, where the primary set of intake wheels, attached to the robot by an axle, roll the artifacts into the robot.  The artifact nearest to the turret can then be driven into the turret, where it is fired, by being pushed by a paddle into the shooter.  )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
